    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're surrounded by alien technology, and you don't know what any of it does. But if you experiment with each new object, perhaps you can figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No tutorials, only carefully-crafted puzzles which guide you to the right realizations without spelling out the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the world and find all 100 levels, you'll have fun gaining mastery over the world of Blackshift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, why not take to the Level Pit, where you can play over a thousand user-made levels, and unleash your own creations on the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/741110/extras/0a3e2be9edd9bdbe06dd6533a33d1085.avif?t=1754051298\" /></div></p>",
